suitable to be enrolled.

No prior systemic therapy for advanced disease, OR recurrence/progression >= 6 months after completion of neoadjuvant/adjuvant therapy or definitive chemoradiation.
Age >= 18 years at informed-consent signature; ECOG performance status 0–1; expected survival > 3 months.
